 * 257 entries each, VALUES ONLY: the interpolation delta is the difference
 * of two ADJACENT entries, so it is read with a second dm(i0,1) rather
 * than stored. That halves the tables to 514 words, which matters -- the
 * value+delta form was 1,024 words and overflowed sec_stak, and DM
 * headroom here is already tight enough that the bus accumulators live in
 * L2. (seg_pmda would have been the tidier home, but nothing has ever used
 * it and the linker does not map it; not worth chasing for 512 words.)
 *
 * WORST ERROR against exact, over the whole mantissa range:
 *     log2 : 2.740e-06 log2 units = 0.000016 dB
 *     2^f  : 9.163e-07 relative   = 0.000008 dB
 * Both BETTER than the 6-term polynomials they replace, which are
 * 0.0001 dB each -- but still a deviation from the current fixed_ref.
 *====================================================================*/

